"Anger en fast lista över krypterade DNS-serveradresser som ska annonseras "
"via DHCPv6/<abbr title=\"Router Advertisement\">RA</abbr> (se %s)."

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/routes.js:212
msgid ""
"Specifies an individual UID or range of UIDs to match, e.g. 1000 to match "
"corresponding UID or 1000-1005 to inclusively match all UIDs within the "
"corresponding range"
msgstr ""
"Anger ett enskilt UID eller ett UID-intervall att matcha, t.ex. 1000 för att "
"matcha motsvarande UID eller 1000–1005 för att matcha alla UID:n i "
"intervallet inklusive ändpunkterna"

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/interfaces.js:756
msgid ""
"Specifies how often (in seconds) clients should check whether IPv6-only mode "
"is still preferred (see %s, odhcpd only)."
msgstr ""
"Anger hur ofta (i sekunder) klienter ska kontrollera om endast IPv6 "
"fortfarande föredras (se %s, endast odhcpd)."

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/routes.js:207
msgid "Specifies the TOS value to match in IP headers"
msgstr "Anger TOS-värdet som ska matchas i IP-huvuden"

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/network.js:997
msgid ""
"Specifies the devices to attach to this VRF. In order to attach wireless "
"networks, choose the associated interface as network in the wireless "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Anger vilka enheter som ska anslutas till denna VRF. För att ansluta "
"trådlösa nätverk väljer du det associerade gränssnittet som nätverk i de "
"trådlösa inställningarna."

#: modules/luci-mod-system/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/mounts.js:272
msgid "Specifies the directory the device is attached to"
msgstr "Anger katalogen som enheten är ansluten till"

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/interfaces.js:906
msgid ""
"Specifies the flags sent in <abbr title=\"Router Advertisement\">RA</abbr> "
"messages, for example to instruct clients to request further information via "
"stateful DHCPv6."
msgstr ""
"Anger flaggorna som skickas i <abbr title=\"Router Advertisement\">RA</abbr>-"
"meddelanden, till exempel för att instruera klienter att begära ytterligare "
"information via tillståndsbaserad DHCPv6."

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/routes.js:192
msgid ""
"Specifies the fwmark and optionally its mask to match, e.g. 0xFF to match "
"mark 255 or 0x0/0x1 to match any even mark value"
msgstr ""
"Anger fwmark och valfritt dess mask som ska matchas, t.ex. 0xFF för att "
"matcha markering 255 eller 0x0/0x1 för att matcha valfritt jämnt "
"markeringsvärde"

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/network.js:891
msgid "Specifies the link monitoring frequency in milliseconds"
msgstr "Anger frekvensen för länkövervakning i millisekunder"

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/routes.js:44
msgid ""
"Specifies the logical interface name of the parent (or master) interface "
"this route belongs to"
msgstr ""
"Anger det logiska gränssnittsnamnet för det överordnade (eller master-) "
"gränssnitt som rutten tillhör"

#: protocols/luci-proto-relay/htdocs/luci-static/resources/protocol/relay.js:175
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum amount of failed ARP requests until hosts are presumed "
"to be dead"
msgstr ""
"Anger maximalt antal misslyckade ARP-begäranden innan värdar antas vara nere"

#: protocols/luci-proto-relay/htdocs/luci-static/resources/protocol/relay.js:171
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum amount of seconds after which hosts are presumed to be "
"dead"
msgstr "Anger maximalt antal sekunder innan värdar antas vara nere"

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/wireless.js:1027
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum transmit power the wireless radio may use. Depending "
"on regulatory requirements and wireless usage, the actual transmit power may "
"be reduced by the driver."
msgstr ""
"Anger den maximala sändningseffekt som den trådlösa radion får använda. "
"Beroende på regulatoriska krav och trådlös användning kan drivrutinen minska "
"den faktiska sändningseffekten."

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/routes.js:80
msgid ""
"Specifies the network gateway. If omitted, the gateway from the parent "
"interface is taken if any, otherwise creates a link scope route. If set to "
"0.0.0.0 no gateway will be specified for the route"
msgstr ""
"Anger nätverkets gateway. Om den utelämnas används gateway från det "
"överordnade gränssnittet om sådan finns, annars skapas en rutt med link-"
"scope. Om värdet är 0.0.0.0 anges ingen gateway för rutten"

#: modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/network.js:800
